  "analysis_md": "解答 原式\n\n$$=\\int_0^1e^{-y^2}\\,dy\\int_0^{\\sqrt{y}}x^2\\,dx=\\frac{1}{3}\\int_0^1y^{\\frac{3}{2}}e^{-y^2}\\,dy=-\\frac{1}{6}\\int_0^1y^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\,d e^{-y^2}=-\\frac{1}{6}y^{\\frac{1}{2}}e^{-y^2}\\Big|_0^1-\\frac{1}{6}\\int_0^1e^{-y^2}\\,d(-y^{\\frac{1}{2}})$$\n\n$$=\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{1}{3e}$$",
